flowchart LR
  D[Managed device\nCloudflare One Client] --> CF[Custom service provider]
  CF -->|Device identity| W[Posture Worker]
  A[Access] -->|Signed device identity| W
  G[Gateway Network policy] -->|Internal L4 context| GW[Route-less Gateway Worker]
  W -->|Device ID lookup| DB[(D1\nMappings and snapshots)]
  GW -->|Unique source-IP lookup| DB
  W -->|Score or signed boolean| A
  GW -->|Number 0 or 100| G
  CRON[Cron trigger\nevery 5 min] --> Q[Cloudflare Queue\nBatched refresh jobs]
  W -->|Unknown device discovery| Q
  Q -->|endpoint_id_list\nup to 100| X[Cortex XDR API]
  X -->|Endpoint state| Q
  Q -->|Verified mapping and score| DB
